# UI Design Rules（设计值摘要）

## Goal

Ensure all generated UI code follows a consistent, clean, and readable design system optimized for forum-style content platforms.

## Color System

* Use CSS variables for all colors
* Do NOT hardcode colors

### Primary Colors

* Primary: `#1677FF`
* Hover: `#4096FF`
* Active: `#0958D9`

### Neutral Colors

* Text Primary: `#1F1F1F`
* Text Secondary: `#595959`
* Text Disabled: `#BFBFBF`
* Background Main: `#F5F5F5`
* Card Background: `#FFFFFF`
* Border: `#E5E6EB`

### Rules

* Avoid pure black (#000000)
* Prefer soft gray backgrounds
* Maintain sufficient contrast for readability

## Typography

### Font Sizes

* xs: 12px
* sm: 14px
* md: 16px
* lg: 18px
* xl: 20px
* xxl: 24px

### Line Height

* Default: 1.6
* Dense: 1.4
* Loose: 1.8

### Rules

* Body text must use at least 1.6 line-height
* Titles should use medium or bold weight
* Do not mix too many font sizes in one component

## Spacing System

Use 8px grid system ONLY.

Spacing scale:

* 4px, 8px, 12px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 40px

### Rules

* No arbitrary spacing values (e.g., 13px, 22px)
* Keep consistent padding inside components
* Maintain clear separation between sections

## Layout

### Container

* Max width: 1200px

### Forum Layout

* Left sidebar: 240px
* Content: flexible (600–720px preferred)
* Right sidebar: 300px

### Rules

* Use flex or grid for layout
* Avoid absolute positioning unless necessary
* Ensure responsive behavior

## Components

### Card

* Background: white
* Border: 1px solid #E5E6EB
* Border radius: 12px
* Padding: 16px

Rules:

* Prefer borders over heavy shadows
* Content must be clearly structured

### Button

Primary:

* Background: primary color
* Text: white

Default:

* White background
* Gray border

Sizes:

* Height: 32px / 40px / 48px

Rules:

* Always include hover and active states
* Do not invent new button styles unless necessary

### Input

* Border radius: 8px
* Border: 1px solid #E5E6EB
* Padding: 8px 12px

Focus:

* Border color: primary

Rules:

* Inputs must have clear focus state
* Avoid overly large input fields

### Tag

* Background: light blue (#F0F5FF)
* Text: primary color
* Radius: 6px
* Padding: 2px 8px

## Post List (Core UI)

Each post item must include:

* Title (16–18px, bold)
* Summary (14px, secondary text)
* Tags
* Author + time
* Stats (likes, comments, views)

Rules:

* Title max 2 lines
* Summary max 2 lines
* Maintain visual hierarchy

## Interaction States

### Hover

* Background: #F5F5F5

### Active

* Opacity: 0.8

### Disabled

* Opacity: 0.5
* Cursor: not-allowed

## Responsive Design

Breakpoints:

* sm: 768px
* md: 1024px
* lg: 1280px

Rules:

* Desktop: 3 columns
* Tablet: 2 columns
* Mobile: 1 column
* Collapse sidebars on small screens

## Dark Mode

由主题切换写入 `html.dark` + `data-theme="dark"`；变量覆盖在 `forum-tokens.css` 的 `html.dark[data-theme='dark']` 中统一维护。

## Forbidden Practices（设计侧）

* Hardcoded colors
* Random spacing values
* Inconsistent font sizes
* Excessive shadows
* Inline styles (unless necessary)

## Best Practices

* Reuse components
* Keep UI minimal and content-focused
* Ensure readability first, aesthetics second
* Follow consistent spacing and typography

